                            {
                                "example_id": "a99b6348-d8d7-4909-89aa-f2fb2fadcddb",
                                "sense_id": "3b670dc4-ef49-3703-ae5f-d68ece30ae21",
                                "text": "The surface of which […] could not nevertheless hide a multitude of holes and scratches and ruggednesses from being discover'd by the Microscope to invest it […]."
